      "text": "，平型关这个名字在今天看来或许只是一个地理坐标，但在1937它却是日军进攻太原的必经之路，是整个华北战局的关键节点",
      "timestamp": 1774405311.473635,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:21:51",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "。它地势险要，一旦失守，日军便可长驱直入山西腹地",
      "timestamp": 1774405317.6486862,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:21:57",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "。对于八路军而言，这里不仅是阻击敌人的战场，更是一个可以充分发挥山地战优势，打一场漂亮伏击战的理想地点",
      "timestamp": 1774405328.358676,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:22:08",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "。基于这些地理因素，我们将游戏版图定在了平型关",
