      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "text": "。电报中说到，国民党第二战区正在组织平型关战役，希望八路军能协同作战",
