      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "text": "。你反复思考衡量，最终决定在桥沟一带精心布置一个口袋阵",
