      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "text": "，你会做出怎样的抉择？呢是选择a果断出击，还是B谨慎观察",
